            "content": [
              {
                "type": "ministry",
                "heading": "MINISTRY OF REHABILITATION"
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "1",
                "text": "Camps for displaced persons from East Pakistan."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "2",
                "text": "Relief for displaced persons (including supplies of medicine, food clothing and other necessities)."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "3",
                "text": "Rehabilitation of displaced persons."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "4",
                "text": "Assistance to displaced persons from East Pakistan in setting up business or industry including provision of settlement on land."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "5",
                "text": "Housing of displaced persons."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "6",
                "text": "Setting up of new industries in displaced persons' townships and colonies and places where there are heavy concentrations of displaced persons from East Pakistan for providing employment."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "7",
                "text": "Matters relating to grants-in-aid to educational, medical and cultural institutions."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "8",
                "text": "Training and employment of displaced persons from East Pakistan."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "9",
                "text": "Management of evacuee property."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "10",
                "text": "Evacuee Interest (Separation) Act, 1951."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "11",
                "text": "The Transfer of Evacuee Deposits Act, 1954."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "12",
                "text": "Displaced Persons (Debts Adjustment) Act, 1951."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "13",
                "text": "All negotiations concerning the evacuee property-movable and immovable of displaced persons from Pakistan left behind by them in Pakistan and restoration of movable property including fire-arms, lockers safe-deposits, etc."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "14",
                "text": "Verification of displaced persons' claims for the immovable property left in West Pakistan."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "15",
                "text": "Settlement of verified claims and payment of rehabilitation grants to displaced persons in respect of immovable property left by them in West Pakistan."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "16",
                "text": "Valuation and disposal of Government built and evacuee properties."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "17",
                "text": "Verification and payment of claims of displaced Government servants of undivided Provinces and servants of States and local bodies in respect of pensions, provident funds, leave salary and security deposits."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "18",
                "text": "Rehabilitation of migrants from Pakistan-occupied areas of Jammu & Kashmir."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "19",
                "text": "Rehabilitation of Muslim migrants who have returned from East Pakistan to west Bengal under the Nehru-Liquat Pact; rehabilitation of Muslims internally displaced in West Bengal at the time of communal disturbances on the partition of the country; and restoration of mosques and other places of religious worship to Muslims in West Bengal."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "20",
                "text": "Dandakaranya Scheme Integrated development of Dandakaranya area for the rehabilitation of East Pakistan displaced persons and welfare of tribals."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "21",
                "text": "Development of such special areas as may be indicated by the Prime Minister from time to time."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "22",
                "text": "All Attached or Subordinate Offices or other organisations concerned with any of the subjects specified in this list."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "1",
                "text": "As regards rehabilitation matters in States, the Central Government is concerned mainly with questions of policy in respect of the subjects marked with an asterisk and is not directly concerned with administrative and executive details which are the functions of the State Governments, except where camps, rehabilitation colonies, educational institutions, training centres, etc. are directly administered by the Central Government."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "2",
                "text": "The administrative control in regard to the items marked with an asterisk in so far as they relate to the displaced persons from East Pakistan in Tripura vests in the Ministry of Home Affairs."
              }
            ],
